    version: '0.5.89',
    name: null,
    body: "## Highlights\n\n- Native deployment provisioning now accepts the Better Auth 1.7 built-in password capability. Upgrading a host that already runs v0.5.87 or v0.5.88 completes the break-glass administrator reconciliation instead of stopping after the service containers become healthy.\n\n## Upgrade notes\n\n- From v0.5.88 to v0.5.89 no database migration or manual configuration change is needed. The release is a deployment hotfix for the native CLI; rerun the normal Tale CLI deployment/adoption flow after the images and CLI are published.\n- The native CLI still refuses a disabled or malformed password policy and verifies the declared credential hash before completing provisioning.\n\n## API contract changes\n\nThe contract moved from 3.43.0 to 3.44.0 (161 → 161 operations). Read the API reference's versioning section before upgrading a pinned client.\n\nAdded operations: none.\n\nRemoved operations: none.\n\n### Changelog\n\n3.44.0 — 2026-10-13: coding agents may sign in to the MCP endpoint unless the operator turns it off (`TALE_MCP_CLIENT_METADATA_DOCUMENTS` and `TALE_MCP_DYNAMIC_CLIENT_REGISTRATION` now default to on): the discovery documents answer on a default deployment — the endpoint's protected-resource metadata at `/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource`, and the sign-in server's own with the agent scopes, `refresh_token`, the metadata-document flag and, for a client that registers itself, a `registration_endpoint` — and the 401 of `/api/v1/mcp` carries the challenge 3.43.0 describes. `agentOAuth` joins the security schemes (OAuth 2.1 authorization code with PKCE, the seven scopes) and the endpoint's security lists it beside the API key. No operation, schema or API key behaviour changes.\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* feat(platform): add the Connected agents page to Settings by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4925\n* Turn on coding-agent sign-in and narrow Codex's scopes by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4926\n* fix(platform): preserve blocked indicators across task filters by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4250\n* chore(deps): update dependency handlebars to v4.7.10 [security] by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4583\n* fix(platform): stage accepted task attachment metadata by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4283\n* fix(platform): keep skill editor visible after saving by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4405\n* docs(platform): say which boot steps wait out a database restart by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4906\n* fix(platform): complete guardrail metrics error state by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4907\n* fix(platform): treat missing credentials as already deleted by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4190\n* fix(platform): preserve adjacent video caption word boundaries by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4195\n* fix(platform): bind connection test results to form revisions by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4196\n* fix(platform): preserve OIDC claim mappings on save by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4212\n* fix(platform): enable explicit malformed standard-agent repair by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4183\n* fix(platform): hide unavailable managed standard agents by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4168\n* fix(platform): preserve search privacy and keyboard focus by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4214\n* fix(platform): require targets for model access rules by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4216\n* fix(platform): retain captured reviewer handoff identity by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4282\n* fix(platform): preserve project-agent app save preconditions by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4322\n* fix(ui): keep keyboard focus in the list after a confirmed row delete by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4273\n* fix(platform): bind failed-send recovery to thread by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4222\n* fix(platform): refresh current user after account name saves by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4262\n* fix(platform): show failed contact, product and website list reads by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4290\n* fix(platform): preserve team roster drafts on refresh by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4233\n* fix(platform): measure Home row contrast and repair the selected row by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4522\n* fix(platform): keep tool time out of the message info model phases by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4923\n* fix(platform): return retry guidance for rate-limited video ingest by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4194\n* fix(platform): serialize concurrent alias registrations by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4220\n* fix(platform): preserve provider-specific usage ledger buckets by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4241\n* fix(platform): retry stale review manifests coherently by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4291\n* fix(sandbox): honor memory overrides and retry disk relief by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4169\n* fix(skills): protect stale edits with entity tags by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4192\n* feat(platform): show trigger readiness beside the live version by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4924\n* feat(platform): improve agent run details by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4683\n* fix(platform): report refused sandbox cancellations by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4263\n* fix(cli): accept Better Auth password capability by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4939\n* docs(release): add v0.5.89 notes by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/4940\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.5.88...v0.5.89",
