    body: "## What's Changed\n* fix: prepare sandbox aliases from pulled release images by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3441\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.5.42...v0.5.43",
