    body: "## What's Changed\n* feat(platform): trigger automation task runs from @-mention comments by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3071\n* fix(platform): carry answered asks into auto-retried agent turns by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3072\n* fix(platform): enable All projects drag and project link by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3067\n* fix(platform): guard async actions while pending by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3073\n* feat(platform): org-wide ⌘K search across projects and tasks by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3074\n* feat(web): add the about page by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3077\n* feat(platform): chat-scoped search palette with escape to global by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3075\n* feat(platform): open projects on Tasks by default by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3076\n* feat(platform): move file indexing onto workpools by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3078\n* fix(platform): show assignee names in task activity timeline by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3079\n* fix(platform): treat email content as untrusted by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3082\n* feat(platform): apply the org PII policy before indexing by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3083\n* feat(platform): find a conversation by its message text by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3084\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.4.16...v0.4.17",
