    body: "## What's Changed\n* fix(platform): open Drive/OneDrive import via connect dialog by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3064\n* feat(platform): all-projects Tasks board by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3065\n* feat(platform): let a message ref pass the retrieval gate by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3062\n* feat(platform): notify project members when an agent asks a question by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3066\n* feat(platform): turn automations into a table list and workbench by @AdeolaAdekoya in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3068\n* fix(platform): pause website scans when the knowledge db is unreachable by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3049\n* fix(platform): clear the automations workbench CI failures by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3069\n* fix(platform): ride the zai coding base and refresh the GLM catalog by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3070\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.4.15...v0.4.16",
