    body: "## What's Changed\n* fix(platform): round-trip the agent model provider pin in the editor by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3060\n* fix(platform): tag email-sync contacts as conversation source by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3063\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.4.14...v0.4.15",
