    version: '0.4.14',
    name: null,
    body: "## What's Changed\n* fix(platform): classify dead-org errors and recover stale clients by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3052\n* fix(ui): allow flush padding on Dialog body by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3045\n* feat(platform): add cloud-import OAuth for Knowledge Documents by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3046\n* docs: price the fix before deferring it by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3054\n* feat(platform): route Microsoft 365 Documents through cloud-import by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3047\n* feat(platform): render task descriptions as prose until edited by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3051\n* fix(platform): label chat task rows with project name and key by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3058\n* feat(platform): Google Drive Documents import and sync by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3048\n* feat(platform): resume last chat and show idle row indicators by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3059\n* fix(platform): show the serving unpinned agent model picks actually use by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3057\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.4.13...v0.4.14",
