    name: null,
    body: "## What's Changed\n* fix(platform): serve default branding when the organization is gone by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3023\n* feat(platform): pin automation agent node models to a provider by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3056\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.4.12...v0.4.13",
