    body: "## What's Changed\n* fix(platform): clearer hierarchy and steadier empty states across catalog, chat, and settings by @AdeolaAdekoya in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2762\n* test(platform): fix automations-grid labels assertion for quiet tone by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2764\n* feat(platform): route inbound conversations to a team or person by address by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2758\n* fix(platform): load baked bgutil plugin and request player PO tokens by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2765\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.3.4...v0.3.5",
